:null,"published_at":"2026-10-22T02:14:00Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114030904","verified_at":"2026-10-22T06:00:43Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4838330-1846651706693602","game_id":"steam-4838330","kind":"update","title":"Patch #1 (v0.1.927)","summary":"Got a quick patch out for the demo, a bigger one that adresses some bugs with multiplayer and bikes is likely coming sometime this week.BugfixesFixed an issue with animations not synchronizing correctly in multiplayerFixed sorting in the inventory (It's still a little funky, we're looking into it more)The Over-Under was super bumpy before, but it's fixed now!Fixed some barriers around the mapFixed an issue with spectating colliding with the bikeFixed the player not centering with the bike, I kno","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-20T03:55:55Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706693602","verified_at":"2026-10-20T17:48:08Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4838330-1846651706693217","game_id":"steam-4838330","kind":"announcement","title":"A VERY SCARY HAIRY BIKE RIDE - DEMO OUT NOW!!!","summary":"A VERY SCARY HAIRY BIKE RIDE — THE DEMO IS OUT NOW!The wait is over! A Very Scary Hairy Bike Ride (DEMO) is now available to play on Steam! Grab your bike, gather your friends, and get ready for a ridiculous adventure across the wilderness as Bigfoot itself!Ride through dangerous terrain, survive the journey, and see what happens when a bunch of Bigfoots take their bikes on a cross-country trip. Whether you're playing solo or teaming up with friends, the road ahead is anything but normal (and us","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-20T00:36:03Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706693217","verified_at":"2026-10-20T17:48:08Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4838330-1843481262700160","game_id":"steam-4838330","kind":"announcement","title":"The AVSHBR Demo Coming to Steam Next Fest!","summary":"THE AVSHBR DEMO IS COMING TO STEAM NEXT FEST!We've got some BIG news to share:A Very Scary Hairy Bike Ride is coming to Steam Next Fest this October!And with it comes your first chance to play the AVSHBR demo on Steam.If you've been following development, you've seen this game grow from a crazy idea into a full co-op survival adventure. Now we're finally getting ready to put it in your hands.PLAY THE DEMO THIS OCTOBERThe Steam Next Fest demo will give you your first taste of the adventure we've ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-13T20:29:05Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1843481262700160","verified_at":"2026-10-20T17:48:08Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4838330-1843481262698954","game_id":"steam-4838330","kind":"announcement","title":"A VERY SCARY HAIRY BIKE RIDE — WISHLIST NOW!!!","summary":"⭐ WISHLIST A VERY SCARY HAIRY BIKE RIDE ON STEAM!We're getting closer to showing you more about this weird ass game, and we need your help!Wishlisting the game helps Steam know that people are interested in AVSHBR and makes it easier for us to reach more players when we have news, updates, and eventually launch.We're incredibly excited to bring this weird little adventure to you, and we hope you'll come along for the ride.Wishlist now and start riding and surviving!!! A Very Scary Hairy Bike Rid","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-13T07:22:10Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_annou